Third-party proxy software
--------------------------

The Docker setup may fetch or build the following proxy engines. These engines
are not part of the Software covered by the MIT License above, and this
project does not relicense or warrant them. Their use and redistribution are
subject to their respective licenses and notices:

* Pipelock — Apache License 2.0:
  https://github.com/luckypipewrench/pipelock/blob/main/LICENSE
* Smokescreen — MIT License:
  https://github.com/stripe/smokescreen/blob/master/LICENSE.txt
* Squid — GNU General Public License, version 2 or later:
  https://github.com/squid-cache/squid/blob/master/COPYING
* iron-proxy — Apache License 2.0:
  https://github.com/ironsh/iron-proxy/blob/main/LICENSE

These components are obtained separately through Docker and are not bundled
with the source distribution or Python package. Other software included in the
Docker images, including base images and system packages, may carry additional
license terms.
